@startuml operation-sequence-diagram
!theme plain
autonumber
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

title OPERATION SERVICE - LẮP ĐẶT CHAI HƯƠNG VÀ ĐÓNG PHIẾU BẢO TRÌ

actor "Kỹ thuật viên" as Tech
participant "BottleInstallationController" as BottleCtrl
participant "BottleInstallationService" as InstallSvc
participant "MachineSlotClient" as MachineClient
database "scentstation_operation" as DB
participant "MaintenanceTicketController" as TicketCtrl
participant "MaintenanceTicketService" as TicketSvc

== PHẦN 1: LẮP ĐẶT CHAI HƯƠNG MỚI VÀO MÁY KIOSK ==
Tech -> BottleCtrl: POST /api/inventory/installations/install\n{tenantId: "1", bottleId: 501, machineId: 10, slotId: 2}
activate BottleCtrl

BottleCtrl -> InstallSvc: installBottle(request)
activate InstallSvc

InstallSvc -> DB: SELECT * FROM bottles WHERE id = 501 AND tenant_id = 1
activate DB
DB --> InstallSvc: Bottle Entity {status: AVAILABLE, productId: 202, bottleCode: "BTL-202-001"}
deactivate DB

InstallSvc -> MachineClient: getSlot(tenantId: "1", machineId: 10, slotId: 2)\n[GET http://machine-service:8084/internal/machines/10/slots/2]
activate MachineClient
MachineClient --> InstallSvc: MachineSlotInfo {slotStatus: EMPTY, configuredProductId: "202"}
deactivate MachineClient

InstallSvc -> InstallSvc: Đối soát: Bottle.productId == Slot.configuredProductId
InstallSvc -> DB: INSERT INTO bottle_installations (bottle_id: 501, machine_id: 10, slot_id: 2)\nUPDATE bottles SET status = 'INSTALLED'\nINSERT INTO bottle_movements (movement_type: 'INSTALL')

InstallSvc -> MachineClient: updateSlotStatus(tenantId: "1", machineId: 10, slotId: 2, bottleId: "501")
activate MachineClient
MachineClient --> InstallSvc: 200 OK (Slot updated to AVAILABLE)
deactivate MachineClient

InstallSvc --> BottleCtrl: BottleInstallationResponse {id: 88, status: "SUCCESS"}
deactivate InstallSvc
BottleCtrl --> Tech: 200 OK {message: "Bottle installed and slot activated"}
deactivate BottleCtrl

== PHẦN 2: HOÀN TẤT VÀ ĐÓNG PHIẾU BẢO TRÌ (CLOSE TICKET) ==
Tech -> TicketCtrl: POST /api/maintenance/tickets/701/close\n{tenantId: 1, closedByActorId: 99}
activate TicketCtrl

TicketCtrl -> TicketSvc: closeTicket(701, request)
activate TicketSvc

TicketSvc -> DB: SELECT * FROM maintenance_tickets WHERE id = 701
activate DB
DB --> TicketSvc: MaintenanceTicket Entity {status: IN_PROGRESS}
deactivate DB

TicketSvc -> DB: SELECT * FROM maintenance_checklist_items WHERE ticket_id = 701
TicketSvc -> DB: SELECT * FROM maintenance_repair_logs WHERE ticket_id = 701
TicketSvc -> DB: SELECT * FROM post_maintenance_tests WHERE ticket_id = 701 ORDER BY id DESC LIMIT 1

TicketSvc -> TicketSvc: validateClose():\n1. Tất cả Checklist item đều completed = true?\n2. Có ít nhất 1 bản ghi RepairLog?\n3. Bài kiểm thử PostTest mới nhất có status == PASSED?

alt Điều kiện kiểm định chưa đạt chuẩn
    TicketSvc --> TicketCtrl: Throw InvalidMaintenanceTicketException("Checklist or Post-test incomplete")
    TicketCtrl --> Tech: 400 Bad Request
else Đạt đầy đủ tiêu chuẩn an toàn
    TicketSvc -> DB: UPDATE maintenance_tickets SET status = 'COMPLETED', closed_at = NOW()
    TicketSvc --> TicketCtrl: MaintenanceTicketResponse {status: 'COMPLETED'}
    TicketCtrl --> Tech: 200 OK {message: "Ticket closed successfully, ready to restore machine"}
end
deactivate TicketSvc
deactivate TicketCtrl

@enduml
